 your build, your playstyle, and your chances of survival. <br><br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269340/extras/eb8ac979760a081211cf1f2557d9b75e.poster.avif?t=1770450727\" width=600 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269340/extras/eb8ac979760a081211cf1f2557d9b75e.webm?t=1770450727\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269340/extras/eb8ac979760a081211cf1f2557d9b75e.mp4?t=1770450727\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge your destiny across ancient temples, cursed lands, and the unforgiving desert. Make impactful decisions, unlock new powers, and determine Horus\u2019 fate. Will you succumb to corruption, or rise as a god?  </p>","developers":["Late Hoot"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269340/header.jpg?t=1770450727","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3269340/938764348/c818157391f956b5e6b8827434f16f0b92fcf224/1758891607/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758892359","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3269340/938764348/c818157391f956b5e6b8827434f16f0b92fcf224/1758891607/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758892359","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3269340/938764348/c818157391f956b5e6b8827434f16f0b92fcf224/1758891607/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1758892359","id":257206865,"name":"Demo Launch Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257206865/7792ba0bd5c394de8c92a4fba9a065cfce18935c/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1758892359"},{"dash_av1":"ht